Muse Glimmer direct vision generation uses the MIT-licensed, lab-owned
mlx-vlm source at commit 8a5e704e0fe43cd8654c144c4ecbd4c8aececeb5.
The vision tower, image processor, projection, and generation implementation
remain in that pinned runtime. mlx2 adds artifact checks and a direct
candidate wrapper; no source implementation was copied into this adapter.
